# Local Worker secrets for `wrangler dev` / `opennextjs-cloudflare preview`.
# Copy to .dev.vars (git-ignored). Every key is optional: the database is not
# here (the Worker reaches it through the HYPERDRIVE binding, wrangler.jsonc),
# and neither is the model — Workers AI answers through the AI binding.
#
# OpenAI instead of Workers AI: set, the SQL is written, explained and charted
# by upstream's own model, gpt-5.4-mini, straight from OpenAI. In stage/prod
# this is a Worker secret the owner sets once per environment:
# `wrangler secret put OPENAI_API_KEY --name nl-postgres-web-<env>`
# (README, "Use OpenAI instead").
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
